pages and if it doesn't have me I don't

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:48.840
read the rest because these guys are
reading hundreds of scripts a week they

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:52.320
don't got time and they've got a good
radar they know it gets it in my

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:56.610
personal opinion I think they give it
half a page or page if your script just

00:01:56.610 --> 00:02:01.649
isn't really good both from a
grammatical structural story standpoint

00:02:01.649 --> 00:02:08.429
whatever it is immediately you're not
going to gain any traction to them so

00:02:08.429 --> 00:02:11.370
